# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored). Never commit real keys.

# ——— Optional cloud (Supabase) ———
# Project Settings → API. Anon key is safe in the browser with RLS.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://shzkqbtoepqqdkjgupry.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_public_key

# ——— Optional live Helper (SpaceXAI / xAI) ———
# Console: https://console.x.ai — model used: grok-4.5
# Base URL: https://api.x.ai/v1
#
# WARNING: Vite prefixes expose this key in the browser bundle.
# Fine for local demos; for public production use a server proxy
# and keep XAI_API_KEY server-side only.
# Without a key, Helper uses built-in scripted coaching (always works).
VITE_XAI_API_KEY=

# Prefer server-side XAI_API_KEY (never VITE_*) with a proxy:
#   Dev:  export XAI_API_KEY=...  then npm run dev  → /api/xai proxies to api.x.ai
#   Vercel: api/xai/chat/completions.js  (set XAI_API_KEY + XAI_PROXY_SECRET)
#   Netlify: netlify/functions/xai-proxy.mjs
# Optional explicit browser base / flags:
# VITE_XAI_BASE_URL=/api/xai
# VITE_XAI_USE_PROXY=true
#
# How the proxy decides you are allowed to spend the API key:
#
#   Preferred — set these two SERVER-side (no VITE_ prefix, so they stay out of
#   the browser bundle) and the proxy verifies the caller's real Supabase
#   session against /auth/v1/user. Same values as VITE_SUPABASE_URL and
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY; they are duplicated without the prefix because the
#   proxy runs on the server and must not read build-time-inlined values.
# SUPABASE_URL=hhttps://shzkqbtoepqqdkjgupry.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_public_key
#
#   Fallback — XAI_PROXY_SECRET, used only when the two above are unset.
#   Do NOT reintroduce VITE_XAI_PROXY_SECRET. Vite inlines VITE_ values into
#   the shipped bundle, so a "secret" sent from the browser is readable by
#   anyone who views source; paired with an Origin check that curl can set
#   freely, it protected nothing. Removed 2026-07-31.
# XAI_PROXY_SECRET=

# Runtime injection (no rebuild): window.__CC_XAI_API_KEY__ /
# window.__CC_XAI_BASE__ for host pages.

